{"34301430692":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":8154}],"bytes":3530477,"camera_position":8154,"comments":[{"author":"94223476@N08","date":"2017-05-04 23:02:11","text":"a life on the ocean wave!"},{"author":"94951113@N04","date":"2017-05-04 23:44:34","text":"One of my favourite types of view :-)\n\nAre those barber haulers on the boom?"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2017-05-05 10:33:51","text":"Yeah, I like views of the sailboat gear too.  There are so many different ways to do it.\n\nI had to look up \"barber haulers\" and now I'm curious about the idea.  On this boom though, striped blue is part of the reefing system.  Green is the backhaul.  Solid blue is the vang/boom preventer.  We are are pretty lazy sail trimmers, but we have been getting better and it helps that Steph's boat is relatively fast as it is and seems to tolerate our skill level well."}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0139.json","filename":"34301430692_ae7d386f14_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/34301430692/","height":3232,"id":"34301430692","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/34301430692/34301430692_ae7d386f14_o.jpg","sha256":"ea35fd6bf9173c3b4cb8e8d49c10e32367de51bf1a69db112a90527d49545f48","tags":["sailing","puget sound"],"taken":"2017-04-06 15:10:27","title":"IMG_0987","uploaded":"2017-05-04 22:45:25","width":5366},"34301430892":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":8152}],"bytes":1788323,"camera_position":8152,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0139.json","filename":"34301430892_597a1da3d9_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/34301430892/","height":2086,"id":"34301430892","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/34301430892/34301430892_597a1da3d9_o.jpg","sha256":"db1c2872c98c6f3d7016f6ac92738e258edbc0535d14273f13be885a50193d62","tags":["sailing","puget sound"],"taken":"2017-04-06 13:51:51","title":"IMG_0961","uploaded":"2017-05